{
  "key": "letter-313-part-01",
  "number": 313,
  "generationId": "01a1e909-49ab-713e-b740-76a1e591b1b0",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1971-313/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.579501
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Come here whenever it is possible.",
      "path": "audio/1971-313/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.778753,
      "end": 3.96458
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "You will always be welcomed.",
      "path": "audio/1971-313/03.mp3",
      "start": 5.152381,
      "end": 6.681973
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "And stay with me a little longer, and let me help.",
      "path": "audio/1971-313/04.mp3",
      "start": 7.929388,
      "end": 11.22068
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "It will be difficult for you because you will have to let go of yourself completely.",
      "path": "audio/1971-313/05.mp3",
      "start": 12.378163,
      "end": 16.957959000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "But it is not impossible - and for you especially because I have seen in you the great potential that is awaiting its opportunity.",
      "path": "audio/1971-313/06.mp3",
      "start": 18.182381,
      "end": 27.07458
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "With you much that is impossible is possible.",
      "path": "audio/1971-313/07.mp3",
      "start": 28.491678,
      "end": 31.531315
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "There is a seed which is longing to explode.",
      "path": "audio/1971-313/08.mp3",
      "start": 32.899048,
      "end": 35.615736999999996
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Its very longing is the source of your search, its longing is the tension that you are today and its longing will be the freedom that you will be tomorrow.",
      "path": "audio/1971-313/09.mp3",
      "start": 36.974875000000004,
      "end": 46.278866
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "The essence is there and the existence will follow if you so wish.",
      "path": "audio/1971-313/10.mp3",
      "start": 48.014943,
      "end": 53.5
    }
  ]
}
